  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orange pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Energetic Heating</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/45/Sunfire_by_xxnightblade08xx.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230404051350\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Sunfire by xxnightblade08xx\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/45/Sunfire_by_xxnightblade08xx.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20230404051350\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/45/Sunfire_by_xxnightblade08xx.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20230404051350 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/45/Sunfire_by_xxnightblade08xx.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230404051350 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Sunfire by xxnightblade08xx\" width=\"270\" height=\"413\" data-image-key=\"Sunfire_by_xxnightblade08xx.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Sunfire by xxnightblade08xx.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Sunfire (Marvel Comics)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb energy and convert it to heat</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb energy and convert it to heat</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Heat Manipulation\">Heat Manipulation</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Heating%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Thermal Capacitance</li>\n<li>Transduction Heating</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Heating%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb energy and convert it to heat. They are capable of creating it as well as heat-related energies from themselves and around them without issue. They can also manipulate their personal thermodynamic forces.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Heating%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Heat Manipulation\">Bio-Heat Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Activation_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Activation Manipulation\">Bio-Activation Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Equivalence_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Equivalence Manipulation\">Bio-Equivalence Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Explosion_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Explosion Manipulation\">Bio-Explosion Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Fire Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Burning_Manipulation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bio-Burning Manipulation\">Bio-Burning Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mass-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Mass-Energy Manipulation\">Mass-Energy Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Entropy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Entropy Manipulation\">Bio-Entropy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Heat_Generation\" title=\"Bio-Heat Generation\">Bio-Heat Generation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Heat_Infusion\" title=\"Bio-Heat Infusion\">Bio-Heat Infusion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Deformation\" title=\"Heat Deformation\">Heat Deformation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Thermal_Ionization\" title=\"Bio-Thermal Ionization\">Bio-Thermal Ionization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Plasma_Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Plasma Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Plasma Fire Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Thermic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Thermic Manipulation\">Bio-Thermic Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Pyric_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Pyric Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Pyric Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionization\" title=\"Bio-Ionization\">Bio-Ionization</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Nuclear Fire Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Heat Manipulation\">Heat Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Manipulation\">Kinetic Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermal_Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Thermal Radiation Manipulation\">Thermal Radiation Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Heat_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Heat Dynamo\">Bio-Heat Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Activation_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Activation Dynamo\">Bio-Activation Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Kinetic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Kinetic Dynamo\">Bio-Kinetic Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Combustion\" title=\"Energetic Combustion\">Energetic Combustion</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energized_Body\" title=\"Energized Body\">Energized Body</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Detection\" title=\"Energy Detection\">Energy Detection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Energy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Energy\">Personal Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Soul_Heat\" title=\"Personal Soul Heat\">Personal Soul Heat</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Soul_Fire\" title=\"Personal Soul Fire\">Personal Soul Fire</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Activation_Energy\" title=\"Personal Activation Energy\">Personal Activation Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Kinetic_Energy\" title=\"Personal Kinetic Energy\">Personal Kinetic Energy</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Internal_Energy\" title=\"Personal Internal Energy\">Personal Internal Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Entropy\" title=\"Personal Entropy\">Personal Entropy</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Thermal_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Thermal Radiation\">Personal Thermal Radiation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Fire\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Fire\">Personal Nuclear Fire</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Plasma_Fire\" title=\"Personal Plasma Fire\">Personal Plasma Fire</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Heating%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric-Heat_Conversion\" title=\"Electric-Heat Conversion\">Electric-Heat Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic-Heat_Conversion\" title=\"Kinetic-Heat Conversion\">Kinetic-Heat Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radio-Heat_Conversion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Radio-Heat Conversion\">Radio-Heat Conversion</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Heating%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Ambient Energy Manipulation\">Ambient Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Capacitance_Manipulation\" title=\"Capacitance Manipulation\">Capacitance Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Manipulation\" title=\"Elemental Manipulation\">Elemental Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Sourcing\" title=\"Energy Sourcing\">Energy Sourcing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Heat Manipulation\">Heat Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Conversion\" title=\"Life-Force Conversion\">Life-Force Conversion</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Heating%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Power may be limited to how much energy user has/can absorb.</li>\n<li>Opposing <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> powers can weaken user.</li>\n<li>The user may be at a disadvantage in areas with a lack of energy to absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Heating%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Prypiatosian-Bs (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li>Firestorm (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Fuego (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Sunfire (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Lucas Bishop (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Garfield Lynns/Firefly/Phosphorus (<i>The Batman</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260807210407\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 148/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTempla